<div class="page-wrapper">
    <NavBanner />
    <div id="cards" class="main-wrapper">
      <section class="section-hero case-study">
        <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-1280 w-container">
          <div class="wrapper-hero fr-1-15">
            <div class="left-hero max-680">
              <div wb-interval-delay="0.2" wb-component="smart-animate" class="gap-4">
                <div class="w-layout-hflex flex-block-2">
                  <a href="/resources/customer-stories" class="text-caps">Customer stories</a>
                  <div class="text-caps">&gt;</div>
                  <div class="text-caps">Clickup</div>
                </div>
                <div class="text-16-150 color-white-80 hide">This wasn’t just about a fresh logo; it was about crafting a brand and digital presence that matched their ambition, stood out in the competitive AI space, and resonated with their target audience.</div>
                <div class="text-16-150 color-white-80 hide">Through close collaboration and iterative feedback, we partnered with them to launch their new identity and create a powerful foundation for growth, ensuring their brand reflected their evolution and their goals as a startup.</div>
                <h1 class="h1">How <span class="span-pink-2">ClickUp</span> Used Animation to Support Retention and Customer Enablement</h1>
                <div class="text-16-150 color-white-80">ClickUp is a long-time customer, returning to us across multiple projects. As an enterprise, they needed more than a discussion partner — they needed an <strong>extension of their marketing, creative, and customer enablement team</strong> to help them focus on the bigger picture.<br><br>That is where Motion The Agency stepped in. We supported their retention and customer enablement campaigns with <strong>short explainer videos, tutorial animations, email GIFs, and social media assets</strong>, making sure every piece stayed on-brand, aligned with their campaign needs, and supported ongoing communication with existing users.</div>
              </div>
              <div wb-interval-delay="0.3" wb-component="smart-animate" class="case-study-tab">
