                        <h2 class="h1"><span class="span-pink-2">ClickUp</span></h2>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-16-150 opacity-80 center-small"><strong>ClickUp</strong> is a productivity and work management platform founded in 2017 and headquartered in <strong>San Diego, California.</strong> As an enterprise team, they needed to keep their internal focus on bigger priorities while continuing to support and strengthen relationships with existing customers. MTA acted as an <strong>extension of their creative team</strong>, helping them create consistent video content for customer enablement, product education, and ongoing client communication.</div>
