                    <div class="text-12-caps opacity-60">ABOUT THE PROJECT</div>
                    <h2 class="h2"><span class="span">The projects</span></h2>
                  </div>
                  <div class="text-16-150 color-white-80">ClickUp first came to us in early 2024 through our <a href="/pricing/motion-graphics-price" class="link"><strong>Fixed Price</strong></a> model, giving them flexible support for short videos, animation assets, and motion design tasks. In late 2025, they returned with a refreshed brand and a need for ongoing creative and marketing support.<br><br>For this case study, we are focusing on their retention, customer enablement, and product education campaigns. What started as a short term project grew into a 12-month <a href="/pricing/design-subscription-services" class="link"><strong>Subscription-based</strong></a> partnership for 2026, with <strong>more than 30 projects completed in the first 6 months,</strong> including:</div>
