              <p class="text-16-150 opacity-80">Within the first six months of the subscription, we completed more than 30 projects for ClickUp. The dedicated team setup helped them move faster, stay consistent with their refreshed brand, and keep customer enablement content moving while their internal team focused on bigger campaigns.</p>
